<is-land on:visible><div id="comp-6NvphGwuCmaMnayxzxb2DD" class="TwoColumnArticle" data-component-type="TwoColumnArticle"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="twoColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForTwoColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why Reyrolle 7SG68?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock two-column-article"><div class="m-t-xl two-column-article-content layout-1-to-1 two-layout-top-alignment"><div class="p-lg-r-lg"><div><p>Modern power distribution systems face increasing complexity, requiring reliable protection and monitoring. Without advanced solutions, utilities risk downtime, inefficient operations, and costly maintenance. The Reyrolle 7SG68 Argus Mini addresses these challenges by providing comprehensive overcurrent and earth fault protection for both high-voltage and low-voltage systems. Its compact design, easy installation, and integrated control, measurement, and monitoring functions reduce installation time, minimize resource use, and ensure operational reliability. This device empowers utilities to maintain safe, efficient, and resilient power distribution networks. </p></div></div><div><div><div><div class="mb-4"><div class="p-0 col-sm-12 m-auto ratio ratio-16x9"><disw-video videoid="e0937701-cc7e-495d-9c81-af2af438deed" locale="en-US" autoplay="false"></disw-video></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="TwoColumnArticle" props-url="/props/6NvphGwuCmaMnayxzxb2DD-en-US.json" page-id="1VOFDrvHiywmVrN4EILH2K" container="comp-6NvphGwuCmaMnayxzxb2DD"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='32VeViZ5HUK5U6Q7lvbJXZ' class